<title>SOUTH AFRICA: CRICKET-BOLAND 133-4 AGAINST BORDER.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-BOLAND 133-4 AGAINST BORDER.</headline>
<dateline>EAST LONDON 1997-01-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Boland, needing 256 from a minimum of 82 overs for victory, were 133 for four from 44 overs at tea on the fourth and final day of their Supersport Series match against Border in East London.</p>
<p>Scores: Border 331 and 201-4 declared (Brad White 54, Mark Boucher 68 not out), Boland 277 and 133-4 (Lloyd Ferreira 53).</p>
